### Working directories

```
Agentbase/        # You are here — all agent configuration
../Codebase/      # Project source — you work here
../Docbase/       # Project documentation and the manifest
```

### Core files

| File | Purpose | Use |
|-------|------|----------|
| `PROJECT.md` | Project definition, environments, rules | Injected into agents with @ |
| `STACK.md` | Technology stack details | Injected with @ when needed |
| `DEVELOPER.md` | Developer profile and preferences | Shapes agent behavior |
| `ARCHITECTURE.md` | Architecture, directory layout, data flow | During feature work and planning |
| `WORKFLOWS.md` | Git flow, deploy, review process | During commit and deploy |
| `ORCHESTRATION.md` | Shared behavior for every agent | Plan mode, subagents, verification decisions |
| `LESSONS.md` | Self-improvement lessons from corrections | At session start and after each correction |
| `BACKLOG.md` | Backlog CLI quick reference | During task management |

